<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Document Conversion</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .header-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .banner-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 300px;
            background-image: url('placeholder_banner.jpg'); /* Placeholder for image */
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 40px 0 10px 0;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 2px;
            background-color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .contact-info {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .image-gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .gallery-item {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background-color: #eee; /* Placeholder for image */
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .text-content {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .text-block {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .callout {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 50px 0;
        }
        .floorplan-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .floorplan-item {
            flex: 1;
            height: 400px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9; /* Placeholder for floorplan image */
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .architect-credit {
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic layout structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="header-logo">
        <div class="logo-icon"></div>
        <div class="logo-text">WEBER STATE UNIVERSITY</div>
    </div>
    <div class="banner-image"></div>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;">OUTDOOR ADVENTURE &amp; WELCOME CENTER</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <div class="contact-info">
        For information regarding naming opportunities or other donation inquiries for the new WSU Outdoor Adventure and Welcome Center, please contact:
        <br>
        <span data-field="contact.name">{{ contact.name }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="contact.title">{{ contact.title }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-title">CURRENT OUTDOOR PROGRAM</div>
    <div class="text-content">
        <div class="text-block">
            <span data-field="program_description_paragraph_1">{{ program_description_paragraph_1 }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-block">
            <span data-field="program_description_paragraph_2">Over the past decade, the increase in demand for outdoor access and education has propelled the WSU Outdoor Program into one of the premier programs in the state and country. Through WSU courses and certifications in areas such as AIARE Avalanche Training and AMGA Single Pitch Climbing Instruction, students and community are more prepared to safely explore the outdoors and facilitate opportunities for others. Additionally, certified guided tours, public equipment rentals, leadership courses, and outdoor permitting provide outdoor access for thousands of participants each year. All of this, while operating out of a <span data-field="current_facility_size">{{ program_description_paragraph_2">Over the past decade, the increase in demand for outdoor access and education has propelled the WSU Outdoor Program into one of the premier programs in the state and country. Through WSU courses and certifications in areas such as AIARE Avalanche Training and AMGA Single Pitch Climbing Instruction, students and community are more prepared to safely explore the outdoors and facilitate opportunities for others. Additionally, certified guided tours, public equipment rentals, leadership courses, and outdoor permitting provide outdoor access for thousands of participants each year. All of this, while operating out of a <span data-field= }}</span>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-block">
            <span data-field="program_description_paragraph_3">In <span data-field="program_start_year">{{ program_description_paragraph_3">In <span data-field= }}</span>, the 3-year average Outdoor Program participation was <span data-field="average_participants">{{ average_participants }}</span> annually. That figure has grown to <span data-field="current_participants">{{ current_participants }}</span> annually as of <span data-field="current_year">{{ current_year }}</span>. In short, our current <span data-field="current_facility_size">{{ current_facility_size }}</span> is insufficient to sustain future growth and we are in need of a state-of-the-art facility to serve the growing demand for outdoor adventure.</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
        WE NEED MORE SPACE!
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-title">FUTURE BUILDING LOCATION</div>
    <div class="floorplan-container">
        <div class="floorplan-item">
            <img src="placeholder_campus_map.png" alt="Campus Map Placeholder" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; left: 10px; font-size: 10px;">WSU Outdoor Program Area</div>
        </div>
        <div class="floorplan-item">
            <img src="placeholder_site_plan.png" alt="Site Plan Placeholder" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 10px;">Village Drive</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: flex-start; height: 80%;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="gallery-item" style="height: 350px;">
                <img src="placeholder_entrance_view_1.jpg" alt="Outdoor Program Entrance View 1" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-item" style="height: 350px;">
                <img src="placeholder_entrance_view_2.jpg" alt="Outdoor Program Entrance View 2" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-item" style="height: 350px;">
                <img src="placeholder_welcome_center_view_1.jpg" alt="Welcome Center View 1" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="gallery-item" style="height: 350px;">
                <img src="placeholder_welcome_center_view_2.jpg" alt="Welcome Center View 2" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center;">
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;">Outdoor Program Entrance</h2>
                <div class="architect-credit">ajc architects</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: normal;">Welcome Center Entrance</h2>
                <div class="architect-credit">ajc architects</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; align-items: flex-start; height: 80%;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="floorplan-item" style="height: 450px;">
                <img src="placeholder_level_1_plan.png" alt="Level 1 Floor Plan" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
                <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; left: 10px; font-size: 10px;">LEVEL 1</div>
                <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 10px;">WEBER STA TE UNIV ERSI</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="floorplan-item" style="height: 450px;">
                <img src="placeholder_level_2_plan.png" alt="Level 2 Floor Plan" style="max-width: 100%; max-height: 100%;">
                <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; left: 10px; font-size: 10px;">LEVEL 2</div>
                <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 10px; right: 10px; font-size: 10px;">WEBER STA TE UNIVERSITY</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic layout structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <!-- Content from Page 1 -->
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; width: 100%;">
    <div style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.2;">
      WEBER STATE UNIVERSITY<br>
      Outdoor Adventure & Welcome Center
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 50px;">
      <div style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px;">
        ajc architects
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- Placeholder for the large architectural rendering -->
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 100px; height: 600px;">
    <!-- In a real scenario, this would be the image -->
    <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: #f9f9f9;">
      Architectural Rendering Placeholder
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <!-- Content from Page 2 -->
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%;">
    <!-- Placeholder for the university logo -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <svg width="100" height="100" viewBox="0 0 100 100" style="fill: #555;">
        <path d="M50 10 L70 50 L50 90 L30 50 Z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="font-family: 'DejaVu Serif', serif; font-size: 36pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">
        WEBER STATE<br>
        UNIVERSITY
      </h1>
      <p style="font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">
        Student Affairs
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></body>
</html>